{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/92814255ca074c5f1dd34734c1b679fec347c49faede18a11f582ddbc17b69365cf8bc1a5c8bef4388cc90a6722d30cb2a5bd7ab80d8b4764fb38bd59f1d5c4ca0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/87adb33a7a1c875d1fd1317c4090e831984cc4267c1b2a38283f3b2a77c02d629cafc604620553322edacfec66f2bc49e977ed7967f91ac65fcd7d22c1390a0d256f5e902e614eb3ea537bde1b9662\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ca1e6c3cd4a3e4bc658f39760eaa7debb0f263c7279ef93d76cae5d1629a22a04ffae8f7ce395eed389a3f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ee0e3a43ce25170c7a0386e80e7e368f30cb14e76f24dd961963e0586aa9c1ac26d58cab894bf237d55c666178a01f89b47574c6d8f729e7189867039cc0b0a032f3f1f2c84ced73df31151b875422\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ed03b22c2af1cf6a9b975d13e90ab5ce4545870ec6dd12f4f25c357a095660daf9cab400404c33a2a843d2121ba732e5c54c9ef02df99d2ee58d37ece2160caff9382567976a1755457dce04fa1337\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0df47d9827e29646d3265f34c33cd4e1ada0a90cc63fee354c8d2f676e65710d74de138d5ffccb1ef4d186cb6c4e42c51b50cf20fa9b959de89c97bbd72657d118f14b1a12f225a7af8a54fbd66c26\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b3f16840b2f1f87f0d56cbb7b81313dcc9ff6efd3f1279b46339f23a0e74763c853ed6ae5ee681449b334bb2f25b33ae5f3ae26f464ca6dddb665277ef687e3bc651323b217282a65bb5da3a5de11d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7498b5e08a19d904242102a12e4a7ff356fff2b3b9a157ce7869dcb3416c16a74d0b8751bdc2d4137076e78a2b085b19135f7fae4ea089a81f6dbf55c50e78c3b8ac7a3baf980e481516e07799e030\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/18cffc49dec1efbe4fb46d3266831e58e9e673a260ad7fe65a110bafeeb8f9c4f87e13630dad43fa3a7bd2340cb635c5e73e815904a86c1df2314fa5898263e01ed41dd248000fac4473b6891ec043\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/28ec3351798b4b83f78cf0238c3b5771359e021fd17e2fc85dabc6b7cf41dc483ca055df4a99c3a56ce98188c1358150b0a4bee2a42b05689c0b7033d21a28c955074a4db98714267c538fc023cc30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6f9c36176b0688724e4c4dc5c2dfddff22df2ca7f626bc5276a2291c5d3d06804aaffa45637832513ce8eaa754064bb3d8d1385ba011e7b76e3938b6648091d2f505827e0dd71d9930f1cbdcdc2dc9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b087d73c301838820dbb215e787215db6d377b34bc6b8a7b6434e0e37619c3dc8e71fe7105ee6a84fa5750fed6604d28a9a015bc315ba98c1f97f58d63cf07c197397781d46fefe96fe486807162c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6e3adfbfa29863bd6d0b2a4e9eb5ffc8c18b7dbc41e8ef975029706bbdfeff07c70da1fe5ad388762b6f5dec7d8c19cbedf9b52f5a23da9325b63231f5cbc97fb0c152af7f4d26fb9f1a5b3f897249\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9e89ab2439c19da0e8ca359c2b02b1584fc5f1e0801a229d24947527e49a2fe48b5d28a2bce05d220d47aef95ed4363c5717d064986a14210e2ab123e7e9b3a7aaede52c36ce9d3a056169b981e856\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7e35458198abe272a39ece87e4bbdd6ecfa7e9e8ce5074b28346c8e14d85df182abf40985e55e4a5361fa27ba323b7a35346d326494193d1e49590f5d234f80228caff906b204e8856ab11d8afa036\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a75892f0398af57e1d48b20080235125e7156fdc87ed7f40979de3fc68d0fa48b121a9143fe727cffa4e4e28ccb8b9a99559b7e13f63242da60698bbb99da0dc74caadb70288be0e9d8911d839ecbe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5f0da6aeeaca269b61ea1a580de2afe6c4f2a1c260c5e7e540be220ee34e0f4a7a1f0a50e517dd18f3c5c1425068ba0d53ca94989d67e76d9af46180160b6b921d61e42a8bc8a7fa3de13f2bbac7c9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/790d2b4fe9ddde3ac31f93565edb7cea27e4d4cc0edf53414f1d74a06f5ffe034419c14c712e938fa739db5d50f964eead539d4f77dfee70c0d16f52b2a5f9e2d1cf7be6487bfd54ae96914ab289bb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/105e3c18187688e63dc591a6425caed79f49eeab941bfd4a8e15e6316322f0aad0c27a301aa65c99d3d94b746fd7571a2e3248f755733cdf934315d9cfeaba5d72a987e13f496197f82c64de54dac5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c0f373dbe9e614c1d36a32f7ffc0011e81e842d5349d09898722b73aef906390db409bb33b5b97074afc57b4ee7a5642fb2cba3c810a1413d331a297b5dd147f2abaca0fd7504007265cf782fb348c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
